{"version":1,"key":"card:780","content":{"id":780,"content":[{"children":[{"text":"我们经常会在开发启动应用时遇到端口被占用的情况。通常可能是在其他命令行窗口启动了服务，但是忘记了关掉，一时之间也不知道在那个命令行窗口，这是我们迫切需要找到这个进程，然后杀掉。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"453cca3a-5423-4f72-8515-1e991f8fe1b7","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"可是我们只知道端口号，那么怎么","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"根据端口号找到进程","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"a1ddb466-229e-46e9-9ae5-142fa9bc9c35","contentId":427,"contentTitle":"Windows 下杀死占用端口的进程","contentType":"card","refId":501,"tauContract":"720a42c66441f65bfc897253311b73deb687a68a60da46dffe8c7b8537a65760","type":"content-link"},{"text":"呢？","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"9ae19a43-5a1e-4ee2-88e0-e86cc09ab208","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"有一个 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"lsof","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 的命令，它的作用是查看进程打开的文件，网络套接字也被认为是文件的一种，因此可以根据此命令找到端口对应的信息。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"2c5edeb8-375f-45b4-a364-f11c64654458","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"最简单的用法如下：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"22a06e61-8533-42c0-8d2f-593e73378744","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"lsof -t -i:端口号","collabId":"dcc95aec-b0a3-45ce-8941-3f3a4fa04db3","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"2f1741d2-3dc4-4389-accc-60578a98cb81","language":"Shell","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"51bc720d-8366-49c9-a2dd-0d429d77184b"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"-i:端口号","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，按端口筛选网络连接","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"41cf31fc-00af-4ab4-a6d8-fd44b74748d8","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"9d13aa30-2a7a-48c0-b197-b3a7121e7f66","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"-t","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，只输出进程的 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"PID","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"0db35286-396b-4a50-a07c-f708277bb4cc","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"566138aa-c09e-4f67-b0db-44db05ab14f6","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"7fd93a8d-cd28-4a21-b39e-2820acedf4e7","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"},{"children":[{"code":true,"text":":端口号 是 -i","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 的网络地址筛选参数，必须与 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"-i","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 连写。例如查找占用 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"5137","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 端口的进程：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"f2fb01da-6773-4007-a698-09873cf86484","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"lsof -t -i:5137\nHello World","collabId":"953d75ac-3a4f-4cfa-bd8b-a36c6658d893","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"b8efffcc-fa1d-43d3-b5e8-b86d7063077e","language":"Shell","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"9c7bc983-7e10-460a-a58d-8adf29d3272c"},{"children":[{"text":"当经常我们发现可能存在多个输出","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"7f412654-631a-4b94-a13b-58428b5f8ca9","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"lsof -t -i :5173\n31360\n42262\n98845","collabId":"ec659982-cd54-4172-9921-52409384f0b0","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"de3ccf02-84e4-4599-9b49-aaf44acc507d","language":"Shell","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"c25fc0c8-0524-441d-af0f-5fcc447eafff"},{"children":[{"text":"这是因为有多个进程涉及这个端口，这些进程可能正在监听这个断开，也可能是与该服务建立连接的其他进程，这是可以通过 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"-sTCP:LISTEN","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 找到监听这个端口的进程：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"385dd78d-ef6e-4ae8-9d97-7815999eb7a0","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"lsof -t -i:5173 -sTCP:LISTEN\n42262","collabId":"140f7d88-b0d4-477b-ac69-2522e3cc7ab1","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"1079595a-f2d3-4dcc-9237-30cbd538c109","language":"Shell","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"aed7cd98-329e-4237-aee0-836c4c4460ec"},{"children":[{"text":"确认 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"PID","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 后，可以先尝试正常结束进程：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"22c5f7e6-e73e-4021-b5cc-844d611c5be9","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"kill PID","collabId":"63ea4252-20ab-477e-a951-e8c9d142b3a6","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"28ee236d-f58d-4cf2-b3d0-2747d0005382","language":"Shell","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"c7b9363f-c88e-40eb-afb1-35ac83bad696"},{"children":[{"text":"如果进程没有退出，再使用强制结束：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"71700b02-8ea8-4398-ad42-72d8ecf5bde9","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"kill -9 PID","collabId":"4bd10290-21d1-491e-b8a5-e295ee92695a","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"b643984e-ed9e-4bee-bb75-df9aa0f7befc","language":"Shell","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"d7f05281-f2d3-43e5-b4fb-604fb707f649"},{"children":[{"text":"也可以组合执行，但执行前应确认命令确实找到了目标进程：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"232ee306-be7f-4a74-abbf-d383bb21d696","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"kill -9 $(lsof -t -i:端口号 -sTCP:LISTEN)","collabId":"b305c228-150b-46fc-ac84-4c94d96e6567","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"b8bcbe76-4b03-4c9e-b786-30b9c13be8dd","language":"Shell","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"406ccdc4-baf3-4e66-800e-2e70c6b6acf5"}],"tags":["技巧"],"createTime":1788512316121,"updateTime":1793532643091,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1793532643091},"links":{"card:501":{"key":"card:501","type":"card","id":501}}}